---
import Logomark from '../../../assets/brand/logomark.svg';
---

<!--
  Light loading screen: the HG symbol fades in while the motion is being prepared, then the
  screen fades out (html.is-ready, set by home-motion). Without JS it never shows; if the script
  fails it still clears itself after 3s (CSS fallback in global.css).
-->
<div class="page-loader" aria-hidden="true" data-loader>
  <Logomark class="page-loader-mark h-12 w-auto text-primary sm:h-14" />
</div>
